<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche to report 1996 results on Monday.</title>
<headline>Roche to report 1996 results on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding AG said it plans to publish its annual results and dividend proposal for 1996 on Monday, March 24, after the close of trading on the Swiss Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The consensus forecast calls for a 1996 profit rise of some 17.6 percent to 3.97 billion Swiss francs after a 1995 group net profit of 3.37 billion.</p>
<p>Roche in January reported that its 1996 sales rose 11 percent to 15.96 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
